WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.100
Okay, people.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.300
Today we're going to be looking at SCP-407.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.540
Object Class: Neutralized

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.460
Special Containment Procedures:

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:16.060
At time of acquisition, SCP-407 was recorded within a compact cassette tape.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:22.180
Currently, SCP-407 is backed-up as a digital audio file on [DATA EXPUNGED].

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:29.640
SCP-407 should not be allowed to play under any circumstances outside testing conditions

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.160
and only with the approval of O5-██.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:38.300
Testing of SCP-407 is to be done in completely sound-proof environments.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.680
All tools and subjects must be sterilized to remove the presence of pollen, fungal spores, plant seeds,

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.680
and as much bacterial life to the greatest degree possible to delay the negative effects of SCP-407.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:56.960
Description:

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:03.840
SCP-407 is a song in an unidentified language, seemingly sung a cappella.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.220
The voices are thought to be human.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:12.320
The tape containing SCP-407 was found with one track of approximately thirty (30) minutes duration,

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:15.120
though the abrupt ending suggests there may be more.

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:22.460
The song has been described by all listeners as something along the lines of 'soothing', 'glorious', and 'beautiful'.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:29.400
While SCP-407 is played, rapid cell generation seems to occur within an auditory radius.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:35.000
This effect seems to occur at the cellular level, and does not require the subject to be able to hear the music.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:39.580
The changes seem to only affect multi-cellular organisms at first,

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:43.620
but quickly begins to affect mitosis in single-celled organisms.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:49.020
During the first minute of exposure, all multi-cellular life forms seem to become healthier.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:54.940
Subjects suffering from malnutrition, scarring, physical injury, or chronic diseases

00:01:54.940 --> 00:02:00.680
or other medical conditions seem to become healthy with only a minute of exposure to SCP-407.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:06.980
This has been shown to cure Alzheimer's disease, Crohn's disease, brain and spinal cord injuries,

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.520
and normally fatal infections or wounds, amongst other things.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:14.220
Interestingly, cancer does not seem to be affected,

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.360
though the subject's physical condition was still vastly improved.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:23.240
During the second and third minute of exposure, subjects start experiencing

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:29.400
unnecessary unrestrained cell growth, manifesting in quickly advancing dermal growths.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:35.000
These growths seem to mostly be benign tumors and calcium and fat deposits,

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.320
which though sometimes painful and disfiguring, are not life threatening.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:44.500
During the fourth minute of exposure, increased bacterial and fungal growth occurs,

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:50.920
creating conditions that grow increasingly dangerous for all exposed life, even in their new healthier states.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:55.660
Respiratory and digestive problems are quick to arrive in most cases,

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.220
and become steadily worse as time progresses.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:04.460
Past five (5) minutes, the effects of SCP-407 seem to differ each trial.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:09.960
In all cases, trace elements of plants or fungus as well as any animal life present

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:16.140
begin to grow and replicate uncontrollably, at varying rates, often shaping into new organisms.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.420
Full results have varied depending on the test,

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:23.380
and on the objects present when SCP-407 is played.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.920
This is Addendum-407-01:

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:37.780
SCP-407 was found in the home of Professor ██████ of ██████████,

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.580
who had recently returned from research in the Amazon regions of northern Brazil.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:46.460
Agents were first alerted to a possible SCP when [DATA EXPUNGED]

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.660
This is Addendum 407-02:

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:55.060
The mold that eventually resulted from SCP-407's second test

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.540
seems to be some sort of Cordyceps Fungi.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:03.260
Noted to be similar to mold encountered by SCP-507.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:07.400
Due to fear of fulfilling a fate similar to that observed by 507,

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:12.800
testing using SCP-407 has been limited to using only the first twenty (20) minutes of the recording.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.400
And this is Addendum 407-03:

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.840
This is a sample test run of SCP-407.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.140
For full research and experimentation notes, see Experiment Log 407.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.960
Sample Test Notes:

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:33.520
Test 2; SCP-407 played for 28m 32s.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:40.860
Within chamber; 1 D-Class personnel, unsterilized.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.660
Twenty five seconds.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:48.320
Subject reports feeling soothed by the music, and of feeling stronger and more invigorated.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.040
Forty five seconds.

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:54.580
Liver spots and scars previously seen are shown to disappear.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.040
Two minutes, twenty.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:02.160
Subject appears to have physically grown an inch. Increase in musculature is noticeable.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.520
Three minutes, forty.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.680
Subject reports intestinal pain.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:09.980
Four minutes, twenty.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.100
Subject begins vomiting.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:17.040
From vomit, plants are seen growing and slowly rooting into the tile floor.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.380
Four minutes, fifty.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.020
Subject starts developing rashes and growths on skin.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.060
Five minutes, thirty.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:27.780
Heavy dermal disfigurement.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.540
Subject panting heavily, begging for help.

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.740
Great pain reported.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.120
Six minutes, ten.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.020
Subject falls to the ground and ceases to move.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.800
Six minutes, forty five.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:47.060
Subject's body is quickly covered in what is thought to be fungal infections.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:52.340
Plant growth is observed growing from the subject's mouth, then eye sockets.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:54.920
Seven minutes, thirty.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:02.000
Subject is by this time unrecognizable, covered in molds and plant shoots.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:06.480
Body bursts as a banana tree emerges from the subject's intestines

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.680
and proceeds to grow to maturity within seconds.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.100
Eight minutes, forty five.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.180
Plant and fungal growth has begun to spread throughout the testing chamber.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:20.260
What appears to be moss and weeds cover the floor.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.520
Nine minutes, thirty.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:27.300
Several shoots, stalks, bushes, and even small trees have appeared.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.980
Banana tree is no longer recognizable;

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:34.160
the tree has grown thick and is covered with foliage and fungal growth.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.200
Ten minutes, thirty.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.560
The air is heavy with pollen and spores.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.260
Vision into testing chamber is difficult.

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.120
Eleven minutes, thirty.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:48.800
Movement is heard within the chamber.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.700
Several different small insect-like creatures are observed.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.980
Creatures are seemingly made of plant matter.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.940
Seventeen minutes, thirty.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:07.240
For the last six minutes, creatures made of plant matter have been observed to rapidly regenerate,

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:11.820
grow to maturity, kill and eat other creatures, and then be eaten themselves.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:16.540
Creatures increasingly progressing in size as time increases.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.600
Nineteen minutes.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.540
Medium sized mammalian creatures are observed;

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:26.700
they seem humanoid and bear a resemblance to initial Subject.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.500
Twenty one minutes.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:33.800
Large fungal stalk is observed to grow from one of the mammalian creatures.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.380
Stalk end bursts, dispensing white spores.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:39.740
Twenty two minutes.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:46.440
Plant growth is still lush, but everything begins to become coated by a layer of mold.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:53.160
The plant creatures seem to die slowly for an unknown reason, before being covered by the mold.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.020
Twenty three minutes.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.160
Mammalian creatures are the last to succumb;

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.860
then heavily decay and become covered in the same mold.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:08.360
Bodies are shown to contract and expand as if breathing.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:14.820
Stalks quickly rise from the bodies, burst with spores, and then just as quickly rot.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.100
Twenty eight minutes, thirty two.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.740
Tape ends.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.360
No change in chamber since the appearance of the mold.

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:26.580
Chamber undergoes rigorous anti-biological cleansing.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.640
Samples of the mold were taken.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.120
End test.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.720
This is Addendum 407-04.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.500
SCP-407 has been deleted from the system

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:43.080
by what is now known to the Foundation as the Interest Group: Serpent's Hand.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:47.000
All known backup copies of SCP-407 have also been deleted.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:51.640
Refer to Incident Report X23.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:00.020
This is Security Breach Incident X23.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:07.120
On ██/.██/██, SCP Site 19 breached by operatives from an organization

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:10.220
known to the Foundation only as ‘The Serpent’s Hand’.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.980
Site-19 Breach:

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:21.020
The breach of Site-19 seems to have been the second of two break ins into SCP properties by ██████████,

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.380
known to the foundation as “L.S.”

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:30.700
This individual was responsible for a previous security breach, having coordinated the theft of SCP-268.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:35.080
Though [DATA EXPUNGED], it is evident from video surveillance

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.920
that SCP-268 was involved in this infiltration.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:42.620
The intruder known as L.S. seems to have simply walked into Site-19.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:47.360
The intrusion seems to have been for the purpose of using SCP-914.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.620
Knowledge of the intruder’s use of SCP-914 can only be assumed

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:55.760
due to the intruders interruption of Dr. ██████ during routine testing.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:59.880
Dr. ██████ seems to have been [DATA EXPUNGED],

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.860
resulting in the intrusion’s only personnel casualty.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:08.360
SCP-407 seems to have been deleted from the Foundation's system during this time,

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:12.400
so it can only be assumed the individuals involved are responsible.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:15.200
Whether this means the file has been completely destroyed,

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:18.920
or possibly in the hands of this rogue group, is unknown.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.940
A short printed note was found in SCP-914's chamber;

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:30.260
this note is the only insight the Foundation currently has of the group responsible for this incident.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.600
See Document X23-01.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.480
Dear Sirs of the Foundation

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.980
Behind guns and protocol you hide;

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.780
desperately chaining the ineffable,

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:51.520
yourselves stuck within your own self-wrought pitiful cages of fear and ignorance.

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:57.260
You think yourselves the shepherd guarding the flocks of the unwise o'er the night,

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:02.300
but you are so shaken by doubt and fear than in your bewildered arrogance,

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:09.660
you would vainly seek to chain the sun itself unto the heavens to hold back the daily night.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:15.120
The delivering angels themselves you contain with three digits and four walls.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:19.900
Do you not see the blindness with which you walk and swing your blade?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:27.080
On the final day, would you have us contain Black Surtr himself with measures and science,

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:34.420
and condemn ourselves to rotten stagnancy as you hold back his pure cleansing fires?

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:40.440
I do not ask you not to act, but act with enlightenment and heart;

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:45.620
neither should one be seduced by the dark nor blinded by the light,

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:50.220
but walk firmly in the twilight and gaze unto all realms.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:58.960
Walk the World of Fire with bare feet and you will find yourself without the scars you never knew you had.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.460
I leave you with one final truth;

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.900
The Garden is the Serpent's place;

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:10.660
the divinities of fear and order who come to walk in the cool evening air are only visitors.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.060
Do not fail to see the evil hiding in the light,

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:19.100
nor the aromatic beauty of the palest flower of darkness.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:22.440
Signed Sincerely,
L.S.

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:30.320
P.S. - You’ll thank me for deleting what you call ‘407’

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.060
This was SCP-407.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:39.940
Ending transmission.

